<title>NETHERLANDS: GOLF-DUTCH OPEN THIRD ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-DUTCH OPEN THIRD ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>HILVERSUM, Netherlands 1997-07-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading third</p>
<p>round scores in the Dutch Open golf championship on Saturday</p>
<p>(Britain unless stated):</p>
<p>200 Sven Struever (Germany) 67 64 69, Russell Claydon</p>
<p>67 68 65</p>
<p>202 Wayne Westner (South Africa) 67 67 68</p>
<p>203 Roger Wessels (South Africa 67 69 67, Daniel</p>
<p>Daniel Chopra (Sweden) 71 67 65</p>
<p>204 Darren Lee 67 69 68, Rogber Chapman 65 71 68,</p>
<p>Angel Cabrera (Argentina) 71 66 67</p>
<p>205 Michael Long (New Zealand) 69 71 65, Richard</p>
<p>Boxall 68 70 67, David Gilford 65 69 71</p>
<p>206 Costantino Rocca (Italy) 68 72 66, Gordon Brand</p>
<p>Jnr 67 70 69, Klas Eriksson (Sweden) 67 70 69,</p>
<p>Miguel Angel Jimenez (Spain) 67 68 71</p>
<p>207 Mark Wiebe (U.S.) 69 69 69, Robert Coles</p>
<p>64 70 73, Robert Karlsson (Sweden) 69 71 67,</p>
<p>Mark Roe 70 71 66, Philip Walton (Ireland)</p>
<p>72 70 65, Sam Torrance 74 68 65</p>
